Route17_Text_RaulIntro::
    .string "People drop all kinds of things\n"
    .string "when the slope gets fast.\p"
    .string "Battle me before you check the\n"
    .string "roadside!$"

Route17_Text_RaulDefeat::
    .string "I lost my grip!$"

Route17_Text_RaulPostBattle::
    .string "You can find good stuff lying\n"
    .string "around on CYCLING ROAD.\p"
    .string "The trick is stopping safely\n"
    .string "before you pick it up.$"

Route17_Text_IsaiahIntro::
    .string "Holding steady on this road\n"
    .string "takes muscle.\p"
    .string "Let's see how strong your stance\n"
    .string "is!$"

Route17_Text_IsaiahDefeat::
    .string "Whoo!\n"
    .string "You held steady!$"

Route17_Text_IsaiahPostBattle::
    .string "I train here because the road\n"
    .string "never lets you coast forever.\p"
    .string "Even stopping is a workout.$"

Route17_Text_VirgilIntro::
    .string "Heading down toward FUCHSIA?\p"
    .string "Then you need road sense as much\n"
    .string "as speed.$"

Route17_Text_VirgilDefeat::
    .string "Clean pass!$"

Route17_Text_VirgilPostBattle::
    .string "The best rides are the ones\n"
    .string "where you never panic.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 17 rewards calm hands.$"

Route17_Text_BillyIntro::
    .string "We're BIKERS!\n"
    .string "We know every rut in this road!$"

Route17_Text_BillyDefeat::
    .string "Smoked on my own road!$"

Route17_Text_BillyPostBattle::
    .string "CYCLING ROAD is more than a\n"
    .string "shortcut.\p"
    .string "It's a test of nerve from\n"
    .string "CELADON to FUCHSIA.$"

Route17_Text_NikolasIntro::
    .string "A sharp spark keeps riders awake\n"
    .string "on the long downhill.\p"
    .string "Let VOLTORB jolt you!$"

Route17_Text_NikolasDefeat::
    .string "Grounded out!$"

Route17_Text_NikolasPostBattle::
    .string "I got my VOLTORB at the abandoned\n"
    .string "POWER PLANT.\p"
    .string "It likes this road's constant\n"
    .string "motion as much as I do.$"

Route17_Text_ZeekIntro::
    .string "I trained hard all along this\n"
    .string "road, but my POKéMON still\l"
    .string "won't evolve. Why?$"

Route17_Text_ZeekDefeat::
    .string "I still don't get it!$"

Route17_Text_ZeekPostBattle::
    .string "Maybe some POKéMON need element\n"
    .string "STONES to evolve.\p"
    .string "Training on a slope can't solve\n"
    .string "everything, I guess.$"

Route17_Text_JamalIntro::
    .string "This road is my exercise track.\p"
    .string "A battle halfway down keeps the\n"
    .string "legs honest!$"

Route17_Text_JamalDefeat::
    .string "Whew!\n"
    .string "Good workout!$"

Route17_Text_JamalPostBattle::
    .string "Going downhill sounds easy until\n"
    .string "you have to keep control.\p"
    .string "That's where the workout hides.$"

Route17_Text_CoreyIntro::
    .string "No smooth city pavement here.\p"
    .string "CYCLING ROAD has its own rules!$"

Route17_Text_CoreyDefeat::
    .string "You read the road better!$"

Route17_Text_CoreyPostBattle::
    .string "I like a road with some bite.\p"
    .string "Makes every trainer show what\n"
    .string "they really believe.$"

Route17_Text_JaxonIntro::
    .string "Nice BIKE!\p"
    .string "How's it handle when the road\n"
    .string "starts dragging you south?$"

Route17_Text_JaxonDefeat::
    .string "Smooth handling!$"

Route17_Text_JaxonPostBattle::
    .string "The slope makes it hard to steer.\p"
    .string "If your hands get tense, the\n"
    .string "whole ride gets worse.$"

Route17_Text_WilliamIntro::
    .string "I stopped to catch my breath,\n"
    .string "but the road won't let me rest.\p"
    .string "Fine, let's battle!$"

Route17_Text_WilliamDefeat::
    .string "Now I'm really bushed!$"

Route17_Text_WilliamPostBattle::
    .string "The benches are too far apart\n"
    .string "on a road this long.\p"
    .string "Next time I'm packing snacks.$"

Route17_Text_RouteSign::
    .string "ROUTE 17\n"
    .string "CELADON CITY - FUCHSIA CITY$"

Route17_Text_CyclingRoadSign::
    .string "CYCLING ROAD\n"
    .string "Slope ends here!$"
